Package: jamaicabaywind
Title: Jamaica Bay Wildlife Refuge Wind Data Dashboard
Version: 1.0.0
Description: Interactive Shiny dashboard displaying wind speed, direction,
    and temperature data from the RM-0002 environmental sensor at West Pond,
    Jamaica Bay Wildlife Refuge, NY. Includes time series plots, wind rose
    diagrams, monthly boxplots, and summary statistics.
